  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MicroFins is a micro credit organisation working in central Serbia. MicroFins has its headoffice in Belgrade and has three branch offices in Kragujevac, Sabac and Vrbas. The organisation operates in 56 municipalities in central Serbia. Sida finances MicroFins with loan capital and administrative costs for the first three months.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MicroFins &#xe4;r en mikrokreditorganisation i Serbien. Huvudkontorert &#xe4;r i Belgrad och tre kontor &#xe4;r utplacerade i Kragujevac, Sabac och Vrbas. Organisationen &#xe4;r aktiv i 56 kommuner i centrala Serbien. Sidas finansiering g&#xe5;r till l&#xe5;nekapital och till admninistrativa kostnader f&#xf6;r de f&#xf6;rsta tre m&#xe5;naderna.</narrative>
  </description>
